\subsubsection*{Reading priorities for the basic assignment.}
\begin{itemize}
\item \textbf{VAE:} Read \citet[Section~19.2]{bishop2024deep}. Prioritize \citet[Sections 2.1--2.5]{kingma2019introduction} for additional detail on the encoder/decoder, ELBO (reconstruction and KL terms), and Gaussian reparameterization.
\item \textbf{Topic models:} Focus on \emph{Using Gibbs Sampling to Discover Topics} in \citet{griffiths2004finding} for the model and sampler. Use \emph{Latent Dirichlet Allocation} in \citet{blei2012probabilistic} for an introductory overview.
\end{itemize}

